ids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, July to August finished at 67% of normal and August to September at 74%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 45% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22079 had its driest year in 1963 at 66%.</p>"}
